<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to {{appName}}</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #1f2937;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f3f4f6;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 24px 16px 32px;
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f97316 0%, #fb923c 50%, #facc15 100%);
      padding: 34px 28px;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 30px;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border-left: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-right: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #111827;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #d1d5db;
      border-radius: 0 0 20px 20px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      background-color: #f97316;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .button-secondary {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      color: #f97316;
      border: 1px solid #f97316;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 999px;
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .feature-box {
      background: #fff7ed;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      margin: 22px 0;
      border: 1px solid #fed7aa;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #111827;
    }
    hr {
      border: none;
      border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .pill {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #fee2e2;
      color: #991b1b;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .detail-card {
      background: #f9fafb;
      border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin: 18px 0;
      word-break: break-word;
    }
    .small {
      color: #6b7280;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <div style="font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:0.9;">{{appName}}</div>
      <h1>Welcome to MenuGo! 🎉</h1>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
      <div class="pill">Restaurant onboarding</div>
      <h2>Hello {{name}},</h2>
      
      <p>Thank you for choosing MenuGo. We're excited to help your restaurant grow with a modern digital experience.</p>
      
      <div class="feature-box">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;">✨ What you can do with MenuGo:</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>📱 Create beautiful digital menus accessible via QR codes</li>
          <li>📊 Track orders and analytics in real-time</li>
          <li>👥 Manage staff and tables efficiently</li>
          <li>💰 Process payments securely</li>
          <li>⭐ Collect and respond to customer reviews</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      {{#if verifyUrl}}
      <p>Your email verification is still required before your account can be fully activated.</p>
      <div style="text-align:center;">
        <a href="{{verifyUrl}}" class="button">Verify Email Address</a>
      </div>
      <div class="detail-card">
        <div class="small">Or copy and paste this verification link into your browser:</div>
        <div>{{verifyUrl}}</div>
      </div>
      {{/if}}

      {{#if temporaryPassword}}
      <div class="detail-card">
        <div class="small">Your temporary password</div>
        <div style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#111827;letter-spacing:0.04em;">{{temporaryPassword}}</div>
      </div>
      <p>Please sign in with the temporary password above, then change it after your first login.</p>
      <div style="text-align:center;">
        <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="button">Sign in to your account</a>
      </div>
      {{else}}
      <p>Your restaurant registration is being prepared for activation. Once verification is complete, you'll be able to manage your menu, orders, staff, and customer experience from your dashboard.</p>
      <div style="text-align:center;">
        <a href="{{onboardingUrl}}" class="button">Start your onboarding</a>
      </div>
      {{/if}}
      
      <hr>
      
      <h3>📚 Getting Started Guide</h3>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Set up your restaurant profile</strong> - Add your restaurant details, logo, and operating hours</li>
        <li><strong>Create your digital menu</strong> - Add categories, items, prices, and descriptions</li>
        <li><strong>Generate QR codes</strong> - Create QR codes for your tables and dining areas</li>
        <li><strong>Train your staff</strong> - Invite staff members and assign roles</li>
        <li><strong>Go live!</strong> - Place QR codes on tables and start accepting orders</li>
      </ol>
      
      <p>If you need any assistance, our support team is here to help. Simply reply to this email or visit our <a href="{{supportUrl}}">support center</a>.</p>
      
      <p>Best regards,<br>
      <strong>The MenuGo Team</strong></p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; 2026 MenuGo. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>
        <a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}">Unsubscribe</a> | 
        <a href="{{privacyUrl}}">Privacy Policy</a> | 
        <a href="{{termsUrl}}">Terms of Service</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>